{"id":"n19548-1-16","stage":0,"title":"주말 · 周末","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n19548-1-16-1","ko":"주말에 잘 쉬었나요?","zh":"周末休息得还好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬었나요?","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2912946c618bd86fcca6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n19548-1-16-2","ko":"네, 가족들과 나들이를 다녀왔습니다.","zh":"嗯，我和家人一起去郊游了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가족들과","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}]